    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3",
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "From Vessel Body Plan to MSS",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1. Body plan (general arrangement)",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- Drawing can be scanned and digitalized manually",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- Geometry file: AutoCad, ShipX, Wamit, Napa, etc.",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2. Hydrodynamic Configuration and Computations",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- SW: Wamit, Shipx (VERES), Octopus (SEAWAY) etc.",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- Computes:",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- Frequency-dependent added mass and potential damping",
            "- Restoring forces",
            "- Froude-Krylov and diffraction forces (1st-order wave loads)",
            "- Wave drift (2nd-order wave loads)",
            "- Viscous roll damping (Ikeda damping etc.)"
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/db74f6b04134f436d8a3e55526532e4fbd46680951b8d9ebddf4586e18216b4a.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3. Post-Processing (MSS Hydro)",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- Computes state-space models for frequency-dependent hydrodynamics",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- Add viscous damping like linear skin friction, ITTC drag, cross-flow drag",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- Add nonlinear maneuvering coefficients",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4. Simulink Vessel Simulator (MSS Hydro)",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- 6 DOF real-time simulation of vessel position, velocity, and acceleration +  wind, current, and wave generators.",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- For a floating vessel the resulting model will be described by 100-200 ODEs. Wave load data for different speeds and headings (0-360 deg) are also included.",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "09/09/2007",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
