    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 14
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "15",
        "page_idx": 14
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Example: Adding Viscous Damping",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Damping B44, B55, B66",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Added mass A44, A55, A66",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/7cf73e5db3581bd0b6ad1ead138fb105a50d5da66f1d6a4bef54d630b6e3f2ae.png",
        "image_caption": [],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Peak is due",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "to IKEDA",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "roll damping",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "theory for",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "bilge keels",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Linear viscous",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "skin friction",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(ramps)",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "09/09/2007",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "16",
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "**Vectorial Vessel Model Representation for Marine Vessels**",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "From Robotics to Ship Modeling (Fossen 1991, PhD thesis)",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Consider the classical robot manipulator model:",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- **q** is a vector of joint angles",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\-     is a vector of torque",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- **M** and **C** are the system inertia and Coriolis matrices",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "This model structure can be used as foundation to write the 6 DOF marine vessel equations of motion in a compact <em>vectorial</em> setting (<strong>Fossen 1994, 2002</strong>):",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- body velocities:",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\\- position and Euler angles:",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- **M, C** and **D** denote the system inertia,    Coriolis and damping matrices",
            "- **g is a vector of gravitational and buoyancy**    **forces and moments**"
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/48fea1834a89ef3c00d3de04946fe2171616d0297d80559c63c3aa220a55d356.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/375547676fd0ff01ed8568b255d20c46389845ea3b127683bbfede0b2fc40b91.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "09/09/2007",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "17",
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Unified Time-Domain Model for Different Speeds and Different Sea States",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "The *Force-Transfer-Functions* are computed using hydrodynamic SW",
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "e.g. **WAMIT**, **VERES** or **SEAWAY**",
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/a9eacf6ae97b3ee384cea112d6fab52ec7b8801d63db5616e5ebf4cf8caaef54.png",
        "image_caption": [],
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/f20ee8f59ee386dd66951c4830e8be655e924ff52f07c05506e36c24f94e0e43.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "*For 6 DOF this model will typically be represented by* *6 + 6 + 90 = 102 ODEs*",
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "*which are computed using*",
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<em>hydrodynamic e.g.</em> <em><strong>WAMIT</strong>,</em> <em><strong>VERES</strong></em> <em>or</em> <em><strong>SEAWAY</strong></em>",
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "*These terms are found using experimental results/curve fitting or*",
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "*semi-empirical methods*",
        "page_idx": 17
    },
